abstract: "Code repository accompanying the Bachelor thesis 'Speech-to-text model for keyword spotting applications in the Papiamento language within a healthcare environment'. Provides a PyTorch implementation of a keyword spotting model for the Papiamento language trained on a dataset of almost 280 participants."
